    "body": "**aterm** is the batteries-included terminal for AI. New here? What each file is:\n\n- `aterm-0.63.0.dmg` — the full batteries-included install for Apple silicon (~1.1 GB).\n- `aterm-0.63.0-mac.zip` — the same signed, notarized app alone (~26 MB).\n- `.sha256` files verify a download: `shasum -a 256 -c <asset>.sha256`.\n\n---\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **One kitty at a time.** Sometimes a second cat was drawn on top of the\n  cursor companion — two overlapping kitties.\n- **The rainbow has no cyan in it.** Blending green into blue used to pass\n  through a saturated teal.\n\n### Added\n\n- **Backspace, Space and Shift each have their own voice** in the typing\n  music.\n",
